{"version":1,"content":"<p>有「人工智能（AI）教父」之稱的諾貝爾物理學獎得主辛頓（Geoffrey Hinton）接受英國《衛報》專訪時警告，預計今明兩年內爆發大規模AI安全事故，例如導致金融或電力系統暫時中斷，其震撼程度堪比1986年切爾諾貝爾核事故，惟有如此方能喚醒各界正視威脅，又直言人類最終或會發現「從未研發AI可能更好」。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T09:05:45.994359+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T08:27:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T12:58:54.362321+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T08:58:30.368010+00:00","content_hash":"b8ae1bf9def02c9d14b9e476f67ce4619134f5da8de0fba8df88fba3976bdf13","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}